# 15. COMPLETE ERP DOCUMENT CONNECTION ENGINE

Build a Document Flow / Related Transactions feature.

Every transaction must retain its source document reference.

### Procurement Connection

PR → RFQ → Supplier Quotation → Comparative Statement → PO → IGP → Inspection → GRN → Supplier Invoice → Accounts Payable → Payment Voucher.

