Warehouse Transfer → From Warehouse Decrease + To Warehouse Increase.

Stock Adjustment → Approved Stock Correction.

Sales Return → Inspection → Restock or Rejection.

Production Issue → Raw Material Consumption.

Production Receipt → Finished Goods Increase.

### Manufacturing Connection

Sales Demand / Forecast → Production Plan → MRP → Material Requisition → Purchase Requisition or Stock Reservation → Material Issue → Production Order → Job Card → Quality Inspection → Finished Goods Receipt → Production Costing → Accounts Posting.

### HR / Payroll Connection

Employee Registration → Attendance → Leave → Overtime → Payroll Calculation → Payroll Approval → Salary Payable → Payment → Accounts Posting.

### School Connection

Admission → Student Registration → Class Allocation → Subject Enrollment → Attendance → Examination → Marks Entry → Result Approval → Fee Challan → Fee Receipt → Student Ledger.

### Hospital Connection

Patient Registration → Appointment → Consultation → Diagnosis → Lab / Radiology → Prescription → Pharmacy Issue → Billing → Payment → Discharge.

### Import Connection

Import Purchase Order → Proforma Invoice → LC / Payment Setup → Shipment → Customs Clearance → Landed Cost → IGP / GRN → Inventory → Accounts Payable.

### Export Connection

