# 21. FINAL DEVELOPMENT INSTRUCTIONS TO AI CODE STUDIO

1. Do not build only a prototype with repeated dummy forms.
2. Do not use one common form for all departments.
3. Do not use one common report for all departments.
4. Do not create empty tabs with headings only.
